This repository is the **CALL-E fork** `daftar-call-e`. Binding contract: [`docs/roadmap_v3.md`](docs/roadmap_v3.md) (v3.2+). [`docs/roadmap_v2.md`](docs/roadmap_v2.md) is **frozen heritage** — do not execute its gates.

Origin **must** be `https://github.com/akrmcodes/daftar-call-e.git`. If cwd, workspace, or origin is `daftar-closing-agent`, `03_Ai/daftar`, or any other repo: **STOP**.

